  "id": "immune-response",
  "term": "immune response",
  "definition": "In this source, an immune response is a plant defense reaction activated when certain molecules are detected. It includes early production of reactive oxygen species and increased activity of defense-related genes, and can also involve a later, sustained reactive oxygen species signal.",
